        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Torrent. Roll to Wound for each model in the target unit, to a maximum of 6 Wound rolls. In addition, on an unmodified wound roll of 6, it inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
