          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="1 - Asuryani" id="4435-0896-94ff-cebd" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Faction: Asuryani" id="c72c-bf15-5aaf-5abb" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1114-7875-d463-df17"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Strands of fate" id="0231-22c7-3877-109c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <comment>1 --&gt; Advance roll
2 --&gt; Charge roll
3 --&gt; Psychic test
4 --&gt; Hit roll
5 --&gt; Wound roll
6 --&gt; Saving throw</comment>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If every unit of your Detachment has the ASURYANI or ANHRATHE Keyword, at the start of each battle round, you can make a Strands of Fate roll. 
To do so, roll six D6. You can then retain a number of these dice depending on the size of battle you are playing, as shown below:

DICE--&gt;BR
2 --&gt; Combat Patrol
3 --&gt; Incursion
4 --&gt; Strike Force
5 --&gt; Onslaught

Roll and keep an additional dice for each fielded ASURYANI PSYKER CHARACTER with the Battlefield role of HQ on your Army.

Each instance of a dice result allows you to manipulate a different type of roll once during this battle round, as shown below.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="1" id="8ec9-deef-0823-148e" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="06d3-135c-ed1a-605b" typeName="Dice Result">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="40cd-b21b-c79c-c496">You can manipulate an Advance roll or Battle Focus roll for a unit with ANHRATHE or ASURYANI Keywords. A manipulated roll is considered to be a roll of 6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="2" id="70b9-b197-236e-6bba" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="06d3-135c-ed1a-605b" typeName="Dice Result">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="40cd-b21b-c79c-c496">You can manipulate a Charge roll for a unit with ANHRATHE or ASURYANI Keywords. A manipulated roll is considered to be a roll of 6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="3" id="f195-8027-e23a-fc61" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="06d3-135c-ed1a-605b" typeName="Dice Result">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="40cd-b21b-c79c-c496">You can manipulate a Psychic test roll for a unit with ANHRATHE or ASURYANI Keywords. A manipulated roll is considered to be a roll of 6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="4" id="7e7c-25f4-0938-fbef" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="06d3-135c-ed1a-605b" typeName="Dice Result">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="40cd-b21b-c79c-c496">You can manipulate a Hit roll for a unit with ANHRATHE or ASURYANI Keywords. A manipulated roll is considered to be a roll of 6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="5" id="da8b-5731-a083-8a29" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="06d3-135c-ed1a-605b" typeName="Dice Result">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="40cd-b21b-c79c-c496">You can manipulate a Wound roll for a unit with ANHRATHE or ASURYANI Keywords. A manipulated roll is considered to be a roll of 6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="6" id="0de9-81ca-63b6-4b4b" hidden="false" noindex="true" typeId="06d3-135c-ed1a-605b" typeName="Dice Result">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="40cd-b21b-c79c-c496">You can manipulate a Save throw for a unit with ANHRATHE or ASURYANI Keywords. A manipulated roll is considered to be a roll of 6.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Battle focus move" id="d5ec-3b0e-2963-fdb9" hidden="false" noindex="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, after an ASURYANI INFANTRY, ASURYANI BIKER, ANHRATHE INFANTRY or ANHRATHE BIKER unit has finished making its attacks, unless it Fell Back or Advanced this turn, can make a Battle Focus move.

When it does so, roll one D6, each BIKER model in the unit can move up to a distance in inches equal to the result, INFANTRY models up to half to the result rounding up to the full inch, as if it were your Movement phase.

A unit that makes a Battle Focus move cannot embark within a TRANSPORT model at the end of that move, and until the end of the turn, such a unit is not eligible to declare a charge.

A unit cannot make a Battle Focus move if it arrived as Reinforcements this turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup name="1 - Craftworld" id="b0d5-8497-ddc3-765b" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="7d5c-0041-1b41-a04d" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="55fd-37bd-3e1f-4809" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="b7e9-6928-9a5b-27c9" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry name="Ulthwé" id="2940-0543-965f-7783" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Foresight of the damned" id="d21e-d10c-4670-b77c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this attribute would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 4+, that wound is not lost.
- Each time a model with this attribute makes a Psychic test of 9+, that Psychic power or Psychic action cannot be denied.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Alaitoc" id="7d5c-0041-1b41-a04d" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Fieldcraft" id="63ed-fa22-0373-f579" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a ranged attack is made against a unit with this attribute, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, the unit with this attribute is treated as having the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.
- Each time a ranged attack is made against an VEHICLE or MONSTER unit with this attribute that is entirely on or within a terrain feature, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, then the unit with this attribute is treated as having the benefits of Dense Cover against that attack.
- You can ignore any or all modifiers to the Move characteristic of INFANTRY or BEAST units with this attribute, and you can ignore any or all modifiers to Advance rolls made for such units.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Biel-tan" id="d294-6bda-13ec-342f" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Swordwind" id="b43c-6cab-9a0c-0022" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a unit with this attribute Advances or makes a Battle Focus move, roll 2D3 instead a D6.
- Each time an INFANTRY or ASPECT WARRIOR unit with this attribute fights, add 1 to it&apos;s models Attacks characteristic.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Iyanden" id="f93e-b6a1-6bc4-6cbb" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Stoic endurance" id="2c55-2923-e3f7-8aca" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to Invulnerable saving throws made by units without TITANIC Keyword with this attribute, up to an Invulnerable save of 4+.
- Each time an attack with Strength characteristic of 8 or less is allocated to a model with this attribute, add 1 to Armour saving throws made against that attack.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Saim-hann" id="da2c-5fae-83dd-0b61" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
