                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in a unit with this attribute is destroyed by an attack made by an enemy model, do not remove the model, it can, after the attacking model&apos;s unit has finished making its attacks, either shoot with one of its ranged weapons as if it were your shooting phase or make one attack with one of its melee weapons as if it were the fight phase. After resolving these attacks, the destroyed model is then removed.</characteristic>
                                  </characteristics>
                                </profile>
                              </profiles>
                            </selectionEntry>
