                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack with Strength characteristic of 7 or less is allocated to a WRAITHBONE model with this attribute, add 1 to any armour saving throws made against that attack.</characteristic>
