                                <profile name="Wrath of the dead" id="964c-db4c-c36a-ce78" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">WRAITHBONE units with this attribute are eligible to perform Heroic Interventions as if they were a CHARACTER unit.
When doing so, a WRAITHBONE units is eligible to perform a Heroic Intervention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any enemy unit, instead of 3&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically. Each time that unit makes a Heroic Intervention move, it can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot;. All other rules for Heroic Interventions still apply.</characteristic>
                                  </characteristics>
                                </profile>
                              </profiles>
                            </selectionEntry>
