              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="BR 1+" id="b831-b664-64d6-ee0e" hidden="false" typeId="9f08-b3c3-2f04-87b9" typeName="Battle round">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Power from pain Effect" typeId="d28d-9de3-14ed-2e90">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="BR 2+" id="8500-6f97-4564-6f2e" hidden="false" typeId="9f08-b3c3-2f04-87b9" typeName="Battle round">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Power from pain Effect" typeId="d28d-9de3-14ed-2e90">This unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which they Advanced.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="BR 3+" id="99c0-b19f-71ec-19ae" hidden="false" typeId="9f08-b3c3-2f04-87b9" typeName="Battle round">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Power from pain Effect" typeId="d28d-9de3-14ed-2e90">Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll. If this unit has the VEHICLE or MONSTER keyword, it does not suffer the penalty incurred to its hit rolls for firing Heavy weapons at enemy units that are within Engagement Range of it.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="BR 4+" id="1860-b85e-5a64-535c" hidden="false" typeId="9f08-b3c3-2f04-87b9" typeName="Battle round">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Power from pain Effect" typeId="d28d-9de3-14ed-2e90">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="BR 5+" id="f4df-3178-8239-a857" hidden="false" typeId="9f08-b3c3-2f04-87b9" typeName="Battle round">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Power from pain Effect" typeId="d28d-9de3-14ed-2e90">Each time a Morale test is taken for this unit, it is automatically passed. If this unit&apos;s characteristics can change as it suffers damage, this unit is considered to have double the number of wounds remaining for the purposes of determining what those characteristics are.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup name="Kabal" id="91b6-0d1d-68ed-6927" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="fc3d-c302-a5a0-5730" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="86dd-1809-2744-646d" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="6825-cfc8-1721-6864" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry name="Black hearth" id="fc3d-c302-a5a0-5730" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Thirst for power" id="26c8-fa4f-c9e4-7601" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Units with this attribute that have the Power From Pain ability treat the current battle round as being one higher than it actually is when determining what effects they gain.
- All DRHUKARI SERVANTS units in the Detachment that have the Power From Pain ability also treat the current battle round as being one higher than it actually is when determining what effects they gain.
- Add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of models with this atribute.
- Each time a unit with this attribute is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll when resolving that unit’s attacks.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Flayed skull" id="cfd1-6f2e-d6eb-2d76" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Slay from the skies" id="aeee-a01d-8334-796a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this attribute that can FLY or that is embarked upon a TRANSPORT unit that can FLY makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.
- Add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of VEHICLE units with this attribute.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Obsidian rose" id="70cf-a42e-acd7-8d11" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
