                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit without the VEHICLE, MONSTER or TITANIC Keyword is within 12&quot; of this unit, each time is selected to make a Normal Move, Advance, Fall Back or is selected to charge, roll one D6: on a 5+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
                                  </characteristics>
                                </profile>
                              </profiles>
                            </selectionEntry>
