                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of models with this attribute.
- Each time you make an unmodified saving throw of 6 for a model with this attribute against a melee attack, after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
