            <selectionEntry name="5 - Rillietann" id="5ca6-543a-da77-3ffc" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Faction: Rillietann" id="2e29-9ccd-3ccc-70fc" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="a509-dda6-0e06-c75b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Luck of the Laughing God" id="db7b-7419-edaf-8077" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If every unit of one or more of your Detachments has the RILLIETANN Keyword, at the start of each battle round, you gain 2 Luck re-rolls, and can roll up to 6D6.
If every result in the roll is unique, you gain a number of additional Luck re-rolls equal to the number of D6 rolled. 
Each Luck re-roll can be used to re-roll one hit roll, wound roll, damage roll, saving throw or Advance roll made for a unit from your army.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup name="Saedath" id="7295-c7a2-c55f-2532" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="0641-69dd-0b85-b8ab" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="fc9c-4244-00ab-d1ae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="fc7f-843f-497a-f6fc" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry name="Light Saedath" id="0641-69dd-0b85-b8ab" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Blaze of Light" id="480f-6c5d-6a89-22a6" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit with this characterisation makes a Normal Move or Advances in your Movement phase, in your following Shooting phase, that unit counts as having Remained Stationary. This does not apply if the unit is embarked in a TRANSPORT.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Dark Saedath" id="5074-17fe-8bdc-656c" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Dark deeds" id="f329-8636-1bbc-8329" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this characterisation is destroyed by a melee attack, after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, it suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Twilight Saedath" id="7a17-963d-a2dd-f749" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Twilight falls" id="51a1-c01f-50f7-95b2" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a unit with this characterisation fights, if it made a charge move, was charged, or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of models in that unit.
- Each time a model with this characterisation makes a pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to an additional 2&quot;.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
              </selectionEntryGroups>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="6 - Exodites" id="61f4-aa1a-6422-27e1" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Faction: Aeldari Exodites" id="701e-1659-e5d8-d1dd" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="4a67-024a-2ab2-8193"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Blessing of the World Spirit" id="f1c7-8631-a283-5331" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this ability would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- Each time a model with this ability makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of cover against that attack
- Each time a ranged attack is made against a unit with this ability, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, then the unit with this ability is treated as having the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup name="Knight Host support" id="573e-2ae4-4f3e-6c4f" defaultSelectionEntryId="2684-2c81-68de-eabd" hidden="false">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="517b-f04a-fce7-3abe" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="3a16-ee45-2a24-eb29" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry name="Nightfury Clan" id="7fe0-e12e-cdd0-19bd" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Nightfury Clan" id="cddc-3053-7c0c-175f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack is made against a model with this attribute, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, the model benefits of Light Cover and Dense Cover against that attack.
- Each time a model with this attribute would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Sabre-claw Clan" id="2684-2c81-68de-eabd" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Sabre-claw Clan" id="11c4-fb8d-19e0-64d9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this attribute makes an attack with a melee weapon, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit, and you can re-roll Advance rolls and Charge rolls.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Swifthorn Clan" id="367c-c72c-8351-4f85" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Swifthorn Clan" id="f9cc-f011-57b7-55a4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Unless a model with this attribute has made a Fall Back movement during this turn, during the Shooting phase is considered to have Remained Stationary, and, each time the model makes a ranged attack, the target does not receive the benefits of Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Sea-talon Clan" id="dc81-9158-5533-d57a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Sea-talon Clan" id="e0df-6ed7-a85d-d507" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this attribute makes a melee attack, on an unmodified wound roll of 6, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack, and, if is not at it&apos;s Starting Strength, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
              </selectionEntryGroups>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
    </selectionEntry>
