                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If enemy unit declares a charge against a friendly ASPECT WARRIOR unit within 6&quot; of this AUTARCH model and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, it can make a Battle Focus move.
Until the end of the phase, this unit cannot fire Overwatch, Set to Defend or make aditional Battle Focus moves.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
