                    <profile name="Wireweave net" id="21c0-82ca-5930-c990" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, when the bearer’s unit is selected as a target of a charge, you can select for the bearer to activate the wireweave net. If you do so, roll one D6. On a 2+:
- The charging unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
- Until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from charge rolls made for any unit that declares a charge against the bearer’s unit.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
