          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of each battle round, after making a Strands of Fate roll but before selecting which of those dice to retain, for each FARSEER model from your army that is on the battlefield and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, you can re-roll one of those dice.</characteristic>
