        <profile name="Brides of Death [Aura]" id="0866-d022-09ea-0a97" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;WYCH CULT&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="No Escape" id="195b-b45e-91e4-997a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an enemy unit (excluding TITANIC units) that is within Engagement Range of a model with this ability is selected to Fall Back, roll off with your opponent, subtracting 1 from your opponent’s roll if this model is equipped with a shardnet and impaler. If you win, that unit cannot Fall Back this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
