                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;KABAL&gt; ARCHON or &lt;KABAL&gt; CORE unit is within 3&quot; of this unit, if this unit contains any LHAMAEAN models, each time a model in that unit makes an attack with a Poisoned weapon against units without INORGANIC, VEHICLE and TITANIC Keywords, an unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
