                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly DRUKHARI CORE or DRUKHARI CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
