                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Blast. Each time a unit is hit by this weapon, roll 2D6. If the result is higher than the Leadership characteristic of that unit, it suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
