                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against the bearer’s unit, if the attacking model is more than 18&quot; away, then the bearer’s unit is treated as having the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
