      <profiles>
        <profile name="World&apos;s Song" id="93bb-8e93-5552-d44d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Psychic phase, instead of attempting to manifest psychic powers, this model can reknit the physic form of one friendly AELDARI model from a unit within 3&quot;. If it does, either a model regains D3 lost wounds or bring back a destroyed model of that unit with all it&apos;s Wounds remaining. That model is set up in coherency with the unit. Each unit can have a model reknit once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Worldsinger" id="6f15-0caa-b0e4-7d03" hidden="false" typeId="bc97-dea9-9e88-bb7d" typeName="Psyker">
