                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Focus Will has a warp charge value of 6.
If manifested, select one friendly PSYKER unit within 24&quot; of this PSYKER.
Until the start of your next Psychic phase, add 2 to Psychic tests and Deny the Witch tests taken for that unit.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
