                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Ancestors’ Grace has a warp charge value of 8. If manifested, select one friendly YNNARI unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
