                    <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer fights, no more than one attack can be made with this weapon. Each time an attack is made with this weapon, if a hit is scored against units without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, the target suffers 1 mortal wound and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
