                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, you can select one enemy unit within 9&quot; of this WARLORD and roll 3D6: if the result is greater than the enemy units Leadership characteristic, until the start of your next Movement phase, that enemy unit cannot perform actions (if that unit is currently performing an action, it immediately fails), and it loses the Objective Secured ability.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
