                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">After this model is set up on the battlefield for the first time, choose one of the below:
- Until the end of the battle, add 1 to this WARLORD’s Toughness and Wounds characteristics.
- Until the end of the battle, add 1 to this WARLORD’s Movement and Attacks characteristics.</characteristic>
