                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an unmodified hit roll of 6 is made for a melee attack made by this WARLORD, the target unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to the Damage characteristic of the weapon used for that attack, and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
