                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a melee attack is made against this WARLORD, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the model making the attack may have.</characteristic>
