                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time you make an unmodified saving throw of 4+ for this WARLORD against a melee attack, after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. This WARLORD does not benefit from the second part of the Cursed Blades’ Only the Strong Will Thrive attribute.</characteristic>
