                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- If this WARLORD is not a PSYKER, after you make a Strands of Fate roll, you can choose to retain one additional dice.
- If this WARLORD is a PSYKER, during your Psychic phase, it can attempt to manifest one additional Psychic power of a Psychic discipline it have access to, even if does not know that Psychic power.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
