- This WARLORD is eligible to perform a Heroic Intervention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any enemy unit, instead of 3&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically. Each time this WARLORD makes a Heroic Intervention move, it can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot;. All other rules for Heroic Interventions still apply.</characteristic>
