                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- At the start of your Command phase, this WARLORD regains 1 lost wound.
- When this WARLORD is selected to fight, if any enemy units within Engagement Range of this WARLORD are below Starting Strength, until the end of the phase, add 1 to this WARLORD’s Strength and Attacks characteristics.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
