                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model makes a melee attack, on an unmodified wound roll of 5+, invulnerable saving throws cannot be made against that attack.</characteristic>
